core-sm64: Super Mario 64 (Nintendo 64) via Ghostship
=====================================================

This module is a Nebulos embedding of Ghostship (https://github.com/HarbourMasters/Ghostship, 3.0.0 "Nautilus", commit aefb89b), built from the
local branch `nebulos-local` of ../sm64-src (never pushed). Nebulos is GPLv3; every component below is MIT / zlib / BSD / public-domain style and is
GPLv3-compatible. Nothing from the game is shipped: the user's own ROM is converted into `sm64.o2r` on the device by Torch the first time the game
starts. The module bundles only Torch's extraction recipes (YAML) and the engine archive `ghostship.o2r` (port shaders, fonts, UI resources of the port).

Game code
---------
Ghostship's `src/`, `actors/`, `levels/`, `lib/`, `sound/` ... are derived from the SM64 decompilation (n64decomp/sm64). The decompilation is
reconstructed Nintendo code; the MIT/CC0 labels of the ports do not change that. Same risk class as the other native-port cores of Nebulos (the user
brings the ROM, no game data ships with the app). Personal use.

